### [2026-09-29 / Session 2 — Root Cause Investigation & Fixes]
- [x] Fixed search input request flooding by adding 300ms debounce in `AuditFilterBar.vue` (commit `d5ea9b5`)
- [x] Added deep watcher on `filters` prop in `AuditFilterBar.vue` for browser history synchronization
- [x] Expanded backend search in `AuditLogController.php` to query `details->title`, `details->file_hash`, and `details->email`
- [x] Hardened clipboard copy in `AuditDetailDrawer.vue` with fallback `execCommand('copy')` and `try/catch`
- [x] Added regression tests in `AuditTrailTest.php` covering payload title and hash searches (all 57 tests passing)

## Final Status
- Completed: 2026-09-29
- Tests: ✓ (57/57 passing, 382 assertions)
- Frontend Build: ✓ (Vite production bundle compiled with 0 errors)
- Security Review: ✓ (Role-gated server-side, college scoping enforced, immutable append-only records)

## Lessons & Notes
- DaisyUI component classes (`table`, `card`, `badge`, `modal`, `btn`, `input`, `select`) provided complete, consistent UI without any ad-hoc custom styles.
- Extracted into 4 sub-component partials under `Admin/AuditLogs/Partials/`, keeping all Vue SFC files below 200 lines.
- Kept the backend lean under Ponytail mode: leveraged the existing Eloquent model with `$appends` for category/severity rather than introducing superfluous transformer layers.
